{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月26日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261126.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】醫務衞生局下月30日推出社區藥物名冊，共涵蓋151項藥物，擴闊至泌尿科、眼科及皮膚科，預計有幾多病人可受惠？藥費負擔可以減多少？</p><p>周四的《時事全方位》，請來醫衛局代表探討。</p><p>題目：社區藥物名冊</p><p>熱線電話: 1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.815565+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:33:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:33:07.140995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:29.873355+00:00","content_hash":"eef8b1e16d414b7df2af8a06fd475774245d89fa197367881c2f2e1ad09503a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}